; All polynomial, coefficient-domain and index facts are proved.
; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-norm-degrees.py; checked native terms.
; Positive degree data and the exact formula prove that
; normzero forces both coordinates zero. Conversely, a zero coordinate
; element has normzero. The positive equality direction uses the actual
; coefficient zero decider; no irreducibility or kernel-zero fact is assumed.
